  "honest_reading": [
    "On historical SMS (full runtime engine), scams warned rose from 95.3% to 100.0%, Elevated or High from 56.6% to 92.5% and High from 17.0% to 53.8%; genuine messages warned 1.3%. High requires corroborating rule evidence.",
    "On unseen conversational scams (holdout half), warnings roughly doubled but about half of such scams still score Low, and many genuine conversational or service messages receive a Caution. Word-pattern rules generalise only partly; a meaning-based model or reviewer is the next improvement."
